  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A synthetic pentasaccharide which, apart from the <em>O</em>-methyl group at the reducing end of the molecule, consists of monomeric sugar units which are identical to a sequence of five monomeric sugar units that can be isolated after either chemical or enzymatic cleavage of the polymeric glycosaminoglycans heparin and heparan sulfate."
  ],
